              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ફૂંકાવું (phū̃kāvũ) is built on phū̃kvũ, \"to blow\", with the -ā- that makes a verb happen by itself, as wind does. CDIAL lists phū̃kvũ under phūtka, \"blowing\", a reconstructed form (CDIAL 9102)."
